  "body": "Enjoy the ultimate in easy, lock and leave living at Browns Bay’s exclusive Ocean Breeze Apartments. The boutique, low density waterfront complex comprises just 23 residences and savours an extraordinary location directly across the road from the beachfront reserve. \r\nNumber 4’s single level, studio-style layout is ideally sized for the best in comfortable coastal waterfront living. \r\n\r\nYou’ll feel on holiday at home all year round in this special location, which is tucked at the end of Brown’s Bay’s sought-after Beach front Lane. The reserve, kids playground and beautiful beach are just a few short steps across the street, for morning strolls along the sand, invigorating ocean swims and making summer memories for years to come. \r\n\r\nBrowns Bay’s vast collection of cafes, bars and eateries mean a coffee, cocktail or delicious meal is always just an easy stroll from home. The area’s two supermarkets and abundant shops and services are also within short walking distance. \r\n\r\nEntrance to the building is on the ground floor ,via a secure lobby. Generous proportions throughout are mobility friendly and very accessible, with a glass lift servicing all four levels. Number 4 is allocated a storage locker on the ground floor for the golf clubs, bicycle, paddleboards and suitcases,  as well as a carpark in the secure, covered carparking space above. \r\n\r\nImmaculately presented and showcasing stylish coastal design, the apartment is filled with natural light. A wall of glass connects the open plan living, dining and kitchen. space to the very generous, covered balcony. This creates another living space and is perfect for all weather entertaining while enjoying the beachfront reserve. \r\n\r\nSmoked glass cavity sliders close off the bedroom and the bathroom boasts a stone vanity. Despite the location immersed at the heart of this vibrant coastal promenade, solid masonry construction ensures a very quiet home living environment. \r\n\r\nPhone for viewing times\r\nSam Yeung\r\n021392288",
